{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "budgetbuddy-microservices-2026",
    "name": "BudgetBuddy Microservices API",
    "description": "API collection for BudgetBuddy Microservices\n\n## Setup\n1. Indítsd el: `docker compose up -d`\n2. Várj ~60s amíg minden konténer healthy lesz\n3. Futtasd a **Get Token** requestet — automatikusan beállítja a `bearerToken` változót\n4. Ha nincs még user: Keycloak Admin UI → http://localhost:8080 (admin/admin) → budgetbuddy realm → Users → Add user\n\n## Változók\n- `baseUrl`: http://localhost:5000 (API Gateway)\n- `accountsUrl`: http://localhost:5001\n- `analyticsUrl`: http://localhost:5002\n- `budgetsUrl`: http://localhost:5003\n- `investmentsUrl`: http://localhost:5004\n- `notificationsUrl`: http://localhost:5005\n- `referencedataUrl`: http://localhost:5006\n- `transactionsUrl`: http://localhost:5007\n- `financialUrl`: http://localhost:5008\n- `keycloakUrl`: http://localhost:8080\n- `bearerToken`: automatikusan töltődik Get Token után\n\n## Gateway routing\nMinden kérés az API Gateway-en (5000) át megy:\n- /api/accounts → accounts-service\n- /api/transactions, /api/transfers → transactions-service\n- /api/budgets, /api/budget-alerts → budgets-service\n- /api/investments, /api/portfolio → investments-service\n- /api/dashboard, /api/reports → analytics-service\n- /api/categories, /api/category-types, /api/currencies → referencedata-service\n- /api/prices → financial-service\n- /auth → keycloak",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{bearerToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",             "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accountsUrl",         "value": "http://localhost:5001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "analyticsUrl",        "value": "http://localhost:5002", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "budgetsUrl",          "value": "http://localhost:5003", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "investmentsUrl",      "value": "http://localhost:5004", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notificationsUrl",    "value": "http://localhost:5005", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "referencedataUrl",    "value": "http://localhost:5006", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "transactionsUrl",     "value": "http://localhost:5007", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "financialUrl",        "value": "http://localhost:5008", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "keycloakUrl",         "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bearerToken",   "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken",  "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminToken",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "testUsername",  "value": "user@budgetbuddy.dev", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "testPassword",  "value": "Password123!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminUsername", "value": "admin@budgetbuddy.dev", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Admin123!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accountId",     "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "transactionId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "budgetId",      "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryTypeId","value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "investmentId",  "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth (Keycloak)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Token (password grant)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Got access token', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('bearerToken', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Token set. Expires in: ' + json.expires_in + 's');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type",    "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id",     "value": "budgetbuddy-api" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "budgetbuddy-secret-change-in-production" },
                { "key": "username",      "value": "{{testUsername}}" },
                { "key": "password",      "value": "{{testPassword}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/realms/budgetbuddy/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "realms", "budgetbuddy", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Keycloak password grant. Token automatikusan bekerül a bearerToken változóba.\n\nElőtte hozz létre usert: http://localhost:8080 → admin/admin → Realm: budgetbuddy → Users"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('bearerToken', json.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type",    "value": "refresh_token" },
                { "key": "client_id",     "value": "budgetbuddy-api" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "budgetbuddy-secret-change-in-production" },
                { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "{{refreshToken}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/realms/budgetbuddy/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "realms", "budgetbuddy", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Keycloak Admin — Create User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Először admin tokent kér, majd azzal hozza létre a usert",
                  "pm.sendRequest({",
                  "    url: pm.collectionVariables.get('keycloakUrl') + '/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/token',",
                  "    method: 'POST',",
                  "    header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },",
                  "    body: {",
                  "        mode: 'urlencoded',",
                  "        urlencoded: [",
                  "            { key: 'grant_type', value: 'password' },",
                  "            { key: 'client_id',  value: 'admin-cli' },",
                  "            { key: 'username',   value: 'admin' },",
                  "            { key: 'password',   value: 'admin' }",
                  "        ]",
                  "    }",
                  "}, function(err, res) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', res.json().access_token);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{adminToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Test\",\n  \"lastName\": \"User\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"emailVerified\": true,\n  \"credentials\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"password\",\n      \"value\": \"Password123!\",\n      \"temporary\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/admin/realms/budgetbuddy/users",
              "host": ["{{keycloakUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "realms", "budgetbuddy", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Admin API-n keresztül hoz létre usert. Keycloak Admin UI alternatíva: http://localhost:8080"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
